The bru_fill_missing issue should now be fixed in 2.14.1.9006.
But note that you _also_ need a recent terra version. The related bug in terra was fixed in version 1.8-60 (Released 2025-07-18).
The current version is 1.9-27.

It's still not clear to me what causes the call to bru_fill_missing in your code/data.

Finn

