I have been going through this process and I have a question.

So, I am making about 40 meshes - on for each glade polygon. The glade polygons vary pretty drastically in size. Some are 100m and others are 1km.

They are all going to need the same mesh parameters correct?  Little polygons shouldn't have tiny triangles and big polygons shouldn't have big triangles. I have been reading a bit and haven't found a clear answer. My gut says the triangles should be the same size for every mesh so each research area has the same resolution.

